{"title":"1971 AHSME Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The solution set of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/2/032b8853f5b99d08d14b68a48f3a363205327c7c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6x^2+5x&lt;4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"102\" height=\"16\" /> is the set of all values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> such that\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/2/d4206eb1d6a069286828cc4d4a4cf47f5de92834.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }\\textstyle -2&lt;x&lt;1\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }-\\frac{4}{3}&lt;x&lt;\\frac{1}{2}\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }-\\frac{1}{2}&lt;x&lt;\\frac{4}{3}\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(D) }x&lt;\\textstyle\\frac{1}{2}\\text{ or }x&gt;-\\frac{4}{3}\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }x&lt;-\\frac{4}{3}\\text{ or }x&gt;\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"474\" height=\"43\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We are solving the inequality <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/1/2115900d23207a2adc26f1905c504c1fd2f6c5f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6x^2 + 5x - 4  &lt; 0.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"136\" height=\"16\" />  This can be factored as\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/1/571d3867016c1fb4bf616949ca009e0d70a04a58.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(2x-1)(3x+4) &lt; 0\\]\" width=\"161\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>The graph of this inequality is a parabola facing upwards, so the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Interval\" title=\"Interval\">interval</a> between the roots satisfies the equation. This interval, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/f/05fb76315e6f74ed0b8fe1e6c34c3c22408555c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-\\frac{4}{3}, \\frac{1}{2})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"64\" height=\"38\" />, is answer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/1/a2194b81820e8380be586c1564c3f5d03d5c100d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>-edited by coolmath34\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME\" title=\"1971 AHSME\">1971 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1971 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1971 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1971\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1971_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\"